ODOO042 Translation method is using positional string printf formatting with multiple arguments. Use named placeholders instead
 --> ODOO042.py:1:1
  |
1 | _("%s of %s")
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
2 | _("%(count)s of %(total)s")
3 | _("{} and {}")
  |

